\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (Concilia oecumenica et generalia Ecclesiae catholicae - Concilium Lateranense IV a. 1215)
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f3\b\lang1033\fs24 1\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 . Spiegel vorn: 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f3\b\lang1033\fs24 a\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 . Constitutio 64: [Text setzt ein mit:] \plain \f3\i\lang1033\fs24 in seculo euagentur recipiantur in eisdem monasteriis dispensatiue de nouo mutatis prioribus locis \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 per suas dioeceses publicari.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f3\b\lang1033\fs24 b\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 . Constitutio 65: \plain \f3\i\lang1033\fs24 >De simonia ab episcopis comissa.< >A<vdiuimus de quibusdam episcopis, quod decedentibus ecclesiarum \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 dispendium fideliter conuertenda. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f3\b\lang1033\fs24 c\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 . Constitutio 66: \plain \f3\i\lang1033\fs24 >De paruis ex actionibus super ex equiis mortuorum et benedictione nubencium.< >A<d apostolicam audienciam frequenti relacione peruenit \u8230 \'85 obseruari statuentes \plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 [Text bricht ab].
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f3\b\lang1033\fs24 2\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 . Spiegel hinten: 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f3\b\lang1033\fs24 a\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 . Constitutio 52: [Text setzt ein mit:] \plain \f3\i\lang1033\fs24 statuta domini separare\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f3\b\lang1033\fs24 b\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 . Constitutio 53: \plain \f3\i\lang1033\fs24 >De decimis\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f3\i\lang1033\fs24 dandis.< >I<n aliquibus regionibus quedam \plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 [per]\plain \f3\i\lang1033\fs24 mixte sunt gentes \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 loci consuetudine approbata. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f3\b\lang1033\fs24 c\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 . Constituio 54: \plain \f3\i\lang1033\fs24 >De decimis dandis \plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 [?] \plain \f3\i\lang1033\fs24 diminucione.< >C<\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 [um] \plain \f3\i\lang1033\fs24 non sit in homine quod semen\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f3\i\lang1033\fs24 serenti respondeat \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 de iure debentur. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f3\b\lang1033\fs24 d\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 . Constitutio 55: \plain \f3\i\lang1033\fs24 >De decimis dandis et de terris Cistrensis \plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 [\u8230 \'85]< \plain \f3\i\lang1033\fs24 >N<uper abates Cisterciensis ordinis\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f3\i\lang1033\fs24 statuerunt tu de ce\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 [Text bricht ab].}

