\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f2\b\lang1033\fs24 Homilien/Predigten\plain \f2\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Der Ansetzfalz vorn bietet die direkte Fortsetzung des Ansetzfalz hinten.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f2\b\lang1033\fs24 1. Ansetzfalz vorn:
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 a\plain \f2\lang1033\fs24 . Inneres Blatt:
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f2\b\lang1033\fs24 a-1\plain \f2\lang1033\fs24 . linke Spalte: Is 16,2\endash 8; Is 29,15, Inc. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24 >U<e, qui profundi estis corde, ut a domino \u8230 \'85\plain \f2\lang1033\fs24 ; \plain \f2\b\lang1033\fs24 a-2\plain \f2\lang1033\fs24 . rechte Spalte: Is 29,23\endash 30,7.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f2\b\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 b.\plain \f2\lang1033\fs24  \u196 \'c4u\u223 \'dferes Blatt: 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f2\b\lang1033\fs24 b-1\plain \f2\lang1033\fs24 . rechte Spalte: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Maximus Taurinensis}}\plain \f2\b\lang1033\fs24 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Collectio sermonum antiqua}}\plain \f2\lang1033\fs24  (CPL 0219 a), \plain \f2\b\lang1033\fs24 Sermo 61\plain \f2\lang1033\fs24  (Z. 42), \u8230 \'85] \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24 fuit\plain \f2\lang1033\fs24  [apud iudaeos] \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24 regnum ut transiret ad gentes, tam fluidum ut emanaret ad populos\plain \f2\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24 Nunc autem tanta credentium cogitur densitate, ut fixum et solidum maneat sine fine, sicut scriptura dicit: et regni eius non erit finis\plain \f2\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24 >Secundum Matheum.< In illo tempore cum audisset Johannes in uinculis opera Christi mittens duos \u8230 \'85 \plain \f2\lang1033\fs24 (Mt 11,2\endash 4).{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[2].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17  Gregorius Magnus}}\plain \f2\b\lang1033\fs24 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[2].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Homiliae in Evangelia}}\plain \f2\b\lang1033\fs24 , Homilia VI \plain \f2\lang1033\fs24 (par. 1, Beginn), \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24 >Omelia beati Gregorii pape.< \plain \f2\lang1033\fs24 Inc. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24 >Q<uerendum nobis est, fratres karrissimi, Iohannes propheta et plus quam \plain \f2\lang1033\fs24 [?]\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24  propheta qui uenientem ad Iordanis baptisma \u8230 \'85 esse mundi redemptorem\plain \f2\lang1033\fs24  [Text bricht ab].
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f2\b\lang1033\fs24 2. Ansetzfalz hinten:
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f2\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f2\b\lang1033\fs24 a\plain \f2\lang1033\fs24 . \u196 \'c4u\u223 \'dferes Blatt
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f2\b\lang1033\fs24 a-1\plain \f2\lang1033\fs24 . rechte Spalte: Is 30,8\endash 11; \plain \f2\b\lang1033\fs24 Maximus Taurinensis, Collectio sermonum antiqua\plain \f2\lang1033\fs24  (CPL 0219 a), \plain \f2\b\lang1033\fs24 Sermo 61 \plain \f2\lang1033\fs24 (Z. 2\endash 7), hier Ambrosius zugeschrieben, \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24 >Sermo sancti Ambrosii episcopi.< \plain \f2\lang1033\fs24 [S]\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24 atis habundeque dixisse me credo superiori tractatu \u8230 \'85\plain \f2\lang1033\fs24 ; \plain \f2\b\lang1033\fs24 a-2\plain \f2\lang1033\fs24 . linke Spalte: Is 29,16\endash 23.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f2\b\lang1033\fs24 b.\plain \f2\lang1033\fs24  Inneres Blatt
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f2\b\lang1033\fs24 b-1\plain \f2\lang1033\fs24 . linke Spalte: \plain \f2\b\lang1033\fs24 Maximus Taurinensis, Collectio sermonum antiqua\plain \f2\lang1033\fs24  (CPL 0219 a), \plain \f2\b\lang1033\fs24 Sermo 61\plain \f2\lang1033\fs24  (Zeile 27\endash 31), Texteinschnitt mit Initium: Maximus Taurinensis, Collectio sermonum antiqua (CPL 0219 a), \plain \f2\b\lang1033\fs24 Sermo 61\plain \f2\lang1033\fs24  (Z. 32), Inc. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24 >C<ompellitur ergo operibus nostris dominus, ut \plain \f2\lang1033\fs24 [\u8230 \'85] \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24 misericordiam suam largiatur \u8230 \'85; \plain \f2\b\lang1033\fs24 b-2\plain \f2\lang1033\fs24 . rechte Spalte: \plain \f2\b\lang1033\fs24 Gregorius Magnus, Homiliae in Evangelia\plain \f2\lang1033\fs24  (CPL 1711), \plain \f2\b\lang1033\fs24 Homilia VI \plain \f2\lang1033\fs24 (par. 1, Mitte), Inc. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24 >Q<uem enim precurrens mundo nuntiauerat \u8230 \'85 fuerit scandalizatus in \plain \f2\lang1033\fs24 [Text bricht ab].}

