\plain\par {\listtext\pard\plain\f4\fs24\lang1033 -\tab}\ls2\ilvl0 \plain \f3\lang1066\fs24 Quadruplex missalis ex||positio: lr\u771 ?alis scz allegorica:tropologica #[et] ana||gogica ... || annexis quarund\plain \f2\lang1033\fs24 \u227 \'e3 question\u361 u breui\u361 u || responsis per totum officium ordinatis.||(p ... Johann\u7869 ? Bechoffen ... ||), Basel (Michael Furter, 1505) = VD16 M 5527.
\plain\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx705\tx1410\tx2130\tx2835\tx3540\tx4245\tx4950\tx5670\tx6375\tx7080\tx7785\tx8490\tx8640\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f2\b\lang1033\fs24 C 82\plain \f2\lang1033\fs24 : Pseudo-Vincentius, Bellovacensis: Speculum morale, N\u252 \'fcrnberg (Anton Koberger, 1485) = GW M50612;
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx705\tx1410\tx2130\tx2835\tx3540\tx4245\tx4950\tx5670\tx6375\tx7080\tx7785\tx8490\tx8640\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f2\b\lang1033\fs24 C 385\plain \f2\lang1033\fs24 : zusammengesetzt aus 2 Drucken: 
\par \pard\li720\fi-360\jclisttab\tx0\tx705\tx1410\tx2130\tx2835\tx3540\tx4245\tx4950\tx5670\tx6375\tx7080\tx7785\tx8490\tx8640\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 {\listtext\pard\plain\f4\fs24\lang1033 -\tab}\ls2\ilvl0 Johannes, Duns Scotus: Eximii doctoris magistri Nico||lai de Orbellis super Sententias Compendi\u361 u || putile: eleg\u227 \'e3tiora doctoris subtilis dicta sum=||matim c\u245 \'f5plectens: quod dud\u361 u multis viciat\u361 u || erroribus: castigatissime fuit recognit\u361 u: ac no=||ue impressioni in Hagenaw c\u245 \'f5mendatum.|| [Hrsg.v.(Lodoicus Honnonius. Neruius ||)], Hagenau; Augsburg (Heinrich Gran; Johann Rynmann, 1503) = VD16 J 549; 
